{
  "id": "PRO.7",
  "number": "7",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 7",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember what I say, my child, and never forget what I tell you to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do what I say, and you will live. Be as careful to follow my teaching as you are to protect your eyes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep my teaching with you all the time; write it on your heart. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treat wisdom as your sister, and insight as your closest friend. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They will keep you away from other men's wives, from women with seductive words.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Once I was looking out of the window of my house, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I saw many inexperienced young men, but noticed one foolish fellow in particular. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He was walking along the street near the corner where a certain woman lived. He was passing near her house ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the evening after it was dark. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And then she met him; she was dressed like a prostitute and was making plans. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She was a bold and shameless woman who always walked the streets ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or stood waiting at a corner, sometimes in the streets, sometimes in the market place. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She threw her arms round the young man, kissed him, looked him straight in the eye, and said, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I made my offerings today and have the meat from the sacrifices. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I came out looking for you. I wanted to find you, and here you are! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I've covered my bed with sheets of coloured linen from Egypt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I've perfumed it with myrrh, aloes, and cinnamon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come on! Let's make love all night long. We'll be happy in each other's arms. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "My husband isn't at home. He's gone away on a long journey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He took plenty of money with him and won't be back for two weeks.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So she tempted him with her charms, and he gave in to her smooth talk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suddenly he was going with her like an ox on the way to be slaughtered, like a deer prancing into a trap",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "like a deer prancing into a trap",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "where an arrow would pierce its heart. He was like a bird going into a net — he did not know that his life was in danger.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now then, my sons, listen to me. Pay attention to what I say. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not let such a woman win your heart; don't go wandering after her. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "She has been the ruin of many men and caused the death of too many to count. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you go to her house, you are on the way to the world of the dead. It is a short cut to death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.7.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PRO.8",
    "number": "8",
